    {
      "id": "text-table-items",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 78,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 265,
      "text": "items 商品表\nPK  id           INTEGER\n    title        VARCHAR「120」\n    description  TEXT\n    price        NUMERIC「10,2」CHECK>=0\n    condition    VARCHAR「30」默认 九成新\n    location     VARCHAR「120」默认 校园\n    status       VARCHAR「20」默认 active\n    views        INTEGER 默认 0\n    is_featured  BOOLEAN 默认 0\nFK  seller_id    INTEGER > users.id CASCADE\nFK  category_id  INTEGER > categories.id RESTRICT\n    created_at   DATETIME\n    updated_at   DATETIME",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
